' CP-009 proof: a double-brace documentation comment between two terms of an expression.
' Same as cp-009-brace-between-terms.spin2 with doubled braces.
' Run from the repository root with this file's repository-relative path.
' Expected: rejected with exit status 1 at the statement line.

PUB scaled(speed) : result
  result := speed {{comment between terms}} + 1
